# World 2's strait destroyer, the anti-stall and the zone bonus (SPEC 11, "World 2, slice 2", slice E). Mission 6 on skill 1 (pinned after the world
# has loaded), ghost on. Ctrl+L, D puts the chopper low over the water 94 px east of the aft turret; Ctrl+L, B sets the destroyer's clock 2 s from
# its barrage (the real one is 40 s of the chopper near the ship): a tell of 30 frames (three ranging markers on the water around the chopper:
# a faint ring, the ring opening with red ticks, the full double ring and a flash), then the bursts. Ctrl+L, Y: 2 s from the turrets opening at
# 90 s (each cut to 2 HP, smoking). Ctrl+L, R: every radar site down at once: the zone bonus, "ZONE CLR" in the HUD, "AGK zone clear".
wait-serial "AGK t0" 1000
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x11
wait 5
key 0x06
wait-serial "AGK world 2 loaded" 1500
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x01
wait 30
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x24
wait 30
press fire 2
wait 60
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x22
wait 40
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x35
wait-serial "AGK barrage tell" 300
wait 2
screenshot bar0
wait 10
screenshot bar1
wait 10
screenshot bar2
wait-serial "AGK barrage fire" 60
wait 2
screenshot burst
wait 40
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x15
wait-serial "AGK destroyer open" 300
wait 20
screenshot open
wait 40
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x13
wait-serial "AGK zone clear" 100
wait 20
screenshot zone
wait 30
expect-serial "AGK barrage tell[\s\S]*AGK barrage fire[\s\S]*AGK destroyer open[\s\S]*AGK zone clear"
expect-no-serial "AGK ERR|missing"
expect-no-dropped-frames
expect-max-load 98
expect-min-chip-free 96
